<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it cut Mercantile Bankshares Corp to hold from strong buy, due to price appreciation</p>
<p>-- Analyst John Kline says new 12-18 month price target is $36/shr assuming stock can trade at 12 times estimated 1998 earnings of $3.00/shr</p>
</text>
